      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/postcard-2014-20140505_17052357_02041.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140505_17052357_0204&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/postcard-2014-20140505_17052357_02041.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/postcard-2014-20140505_17053126_0205.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140505_17053126_0205&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/postcard-2014-20140505_17053126_0205.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From: Dan, To: Bess Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Mailed From: Mackinac Island, Michigan on August 9, 1913&lt;br&gt;
Picture Info: 98882 South Boulevard, Showing the Devil’s Kitchen, Mackinac Island, Michigan.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Miss Bess Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Pearl, Illinois&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having nice trip, just a little rough. Was at the Niagara Falls last Wednesday. Then left Wednesday Eve from Buffalo for Chicago.&lt;br&gt;
Dan&lt;/p&gt;</description>
